{"id":"46b2495f214783c3","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","title":"Forcing Relation","display":"df-forcing-relation — Forcing Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-forcing-relation","aliases":["58-df-forcing-relation"],"display":"df-forcing-relation — Forcing Relation","depends_on":["[[./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-forcing-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-forcing-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-forcing-relation — Forcing Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 是依次显式接收地模型、条件、对象语言公式码、有限名字元组、偏序载体和序关系的迫使关系（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 是本文件给出的规范别名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\)</span> 是它的完全参数化显示记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}relation\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\Bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}relation\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\Bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件不再维护一套与规范六元关系竞争的递归定义；公式良构性、自由变元、名字求值、泛型扩张与满足递归均由上游精确关系统一处理。</li>\n<li>旧写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\)</span> 只能在上下文已经唯一固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> 时作为排版缩写，并须展开为这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\)</span>；不能据此把同一载体上的不同偏序混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-zfc-forc